* Issue
  Currently, the reason things arent working may be due to how things are added
  We are currently adding in two phases
  Adding to the Loop, and adding to the hashmap
  We do this twice (unknowingly)
  One when the recorder goes past, for RDO, and once for the actual write
  This means we are adding coeffs twice incorrectly
  We actually, only want to add if its the real write

  Additionally, we are adding at an offset, which means we are adding if the
  current frame is encoded, but not adding the current frames hashes, which is
  wrong
